; dsv4-hook-door-control.fk — the serve cell composing the decode-hook door with the
; earned control-verdict recipe. A carrier spawns `fkwu` on THIS file to hold the
; resident door; prepare fits the centroids once, then every request is served from
; that state. ready=1 with prepare_ms is printed before the first request is read.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/dsv4-decode-hook-door.fk form-stdlib/dsv4-hook-recipe-control.fk

(dhd-serve dhrc-id dhrc-prepare dhrc-offer)
